                "text": "The reality is that people's health insurance premiums are skyrocketing.\n\nToday, a constituent of mine checked their health insurance bill. It shot up to $2,210.97 per month.\n\n@SpeakerJohnson can stop this. https://t.co/5nwhGfR25m",
